      <activity id="5c45b4f3-e38b-5d62-bf2d-e623c5ff4f48" activityNameId="f56a7f4d-22dc-5b12-962b-6479b7eada72" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Acetic acid from butane, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Acetic acid from butane, at plant
The multioutput-process "formic acid production, butane oxidation process"  delivers the co-products formic acid, methyl acetate, ethyl acetate, acetic acid, methyl ethyl ketone, and acetone. The allocation is based on mass balance.;
UUID: 1a7242c7-3e43-30bc-9cee-9e5182f17216
Butane oxidation including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Oxidation of butane
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1a7242c7-3e43-30bc-9cee-9e5182f17216.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
